nd-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav><a class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 bg-brand-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-ivory transition duration-300 hover:bg-brand-800 lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/career\">加入我們<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"開啟選單\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-brand-900/20 text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-brand-900 hover:text-ivory lg:hidden\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">☰</span></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 pt-20 text-ivory\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">JOIN GOOD ANGEL</p></div></div><div><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">加入好天使</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/60 md:text-lg md:leading-9\">我們正在尋找願意學習、願意交流，也願意和團隊一起成長的夥伴。你的起點不必相同，但我們可以朝同一個方向前進。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"h-px bg-white/10\"></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">WHO WE ARE LOOKING FOR</p></div></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl\">我們在找的，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">不只是漂亮的履歷。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg\">經驗與專業可以持續累積。 比起一開始就什麼都會，我們更在意一個人面對新事物的態度， 以及是否願意與團隊共同前進。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid border-t border-brand-900/15 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-12 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">願意學習</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">不需要一開始就熟悉所有不動產與財商知識，我們更重視你是否願意理解產業、主動學習並持續累積。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-12 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">願意交流</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">我們相信好的團隊來自彼此分享觀點與經驗，願意溝通、傾聽與合作，是一起前進的重要基礎。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-12 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900\">願意成長</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">每個人的起點與專長都不同，重要的是願意從實務中累積經驗，逐步建立自己的專業方向。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-paper\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">WHAT YOU WILL EXPLORE</p></div><h2 class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl\">在這裡，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">專業從實際參與開始。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl leading-8 text-muted\">好天使結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育。 在參與團隊的過程中，你會逐步接觸不同領域的知識與經驗。</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-brand-900/15\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-7\"><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><p class=\"text-lg font-medium text-brand-900 md:text-xl\">不動產市場與實務</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-7\"><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><p class=\"text-lg font-medium text-brand-900 md:text-xl\">財商觀念與資產思維</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-7\"><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><p class=\"text-lg font-medium text-brand-900 md:text-xl\">案例討論與經驗交流</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-7\"><span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">04</span><p class=\"text-lg font-medium text-brand-900 md:text-xl\">團隊合作與專業成長</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell py-20 md:py-24\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">START YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2 class=\"mt-6 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-6xl\">如果你也想看看，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">自己還能走到哪裡。</span></h2></div><div><p class=\"max-w-xl leading-8 text-white/60\">想進一步了解團隊、工作機會或加入方式， 歡迎直接與好天使聯絡。</p><a class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-12 bg-[#c7d98f] px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-[#1f3326] transition duration-300 hover:bg-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\"><span>與我們聯絡</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start md:py-16\"><div><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p></div><nav class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:text-right\"><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-[11px] text-white/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 好天使不動產財商團隊</p><p class=\"tracking-[0.16em]\">REAL ESTATE · FINANCE · GROWTH</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3z5q_p4msz2ha.js\" id=\"_R_\" asyn